  4. Terminate on stop_reason="end_turn" with all tests passing OR after 8 turns.
  5. Surface tool errors back to the model; never crash on a tool exception.

Pre-tool guardrail (M5 hook equivalent in code):
  - Refuse edit_file if path matches `.env`, `alembic/versions/`, or `tests/conftest.py`.
  - Print "blocked: <reason>" + feed `{"blocked": "..."}` as the tool result.
"""
